                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I had a constructive meeting with The Maryland State Medical Society, commonly known as MedChi, and their President Dr. Padmini Ranasinghe to discuss crucial areas of public health such as increasing #Medicare coverage and the state\u2019s AHEAD Model \u2013 which aims to deliver high-quality care through greater coordination and health equity.\n\u00a0\nIt was invaluable to receive MedChi\u2019s perspective on building a healthier future for our state.\n\u00a0\n#MedChi #MarylandStateMedicalSociety #Physicians #PublicHealth #HealthyFuture #Health #Healthcare #MDHealth #Medicine",
