                "text": "\ud83c\udfe51.1 million Marylanders rely on #Medicaid to receive health coverage.\n\u00a0\nRepublicans want to impose historic cuts\u2702\ufe0f to this program and take health care away from kids, parents, people with disabilities, and seniors.\n\u00a0\nOn #MedicaidMattersDayofAction, I vow to continue fighting to save Medicaid and protect Americans from policies that would devastate families.\n\u00a0\n#HandsOff\u00a0\n#HandsOffMedicaid\n#ProtectMedicaid\u00a0\n#MedicaidMatters",
