                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I introduced legislation with @ChrisVanHollen to award Henrietta Lacks the #CongressionalGoldMedal in recognition of her \"HeLa cells\" which have made contributions to global health, scientific research, quality of life, and patients\u2019 rights.\u00a0\n\nAs Donald Trump looks to remove Black history from America's story, we must continue to uplift Black historymakers like Mrs. Lacks now more than ever.\n\u00a0\nIf you erase it, we will replace it!",
